{"id":"vod_zy360_94600","vodId":"94600","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"黄泉的使者","name_cn":"黄泉的使者","date":"2026-01-01","year":"2026","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至24集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20260405-1/35a486f7cf3b659b2fc358f3c2a38a3e.webp"},"summary":"　月落和亚晨是一对双胞胎兄妹，他们在一个与世隔绝的深山小村落里出生，被称为“分隔夜与昼的双子”。他们拥有获得特殊力量的资格，一场围绕他们的双使战斗也随之展开。　　双使是一种成对的存在，被人类冠以“幽灵”、“怪物”、“怪兽”或“异形”等各种各样的称呼。它们并非人人可见，各自拥有不同的外表、性格和能力。每对双使都有一个与之缔结契约的主子，而指挥它们的主子被称为“双使师”。　　许多大人在双胞兄妹开始懂事前就暗中操纵，试图夺取他们的力量，因此月落和亚晨在年幼时就被迫分离。本作故事以兄妹俩的重逢展开序幕。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-09-20 14:37:39","episodeCount":24,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260405/u7yWWlE1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260412/ODrOFaTF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260419/1lMHRXdN/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260426/zRfZKmp9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260503/BZqjws1k/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260510/MN5xpkCi/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260517/e2AVuVoO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260524/QjYgLJR6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260531/ZSbWcAyp/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260607/gYpo9kPn/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260614/zGo3gryH/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260621/8t7eGs5p/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260705/fbTCxWeq/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260712/NxteCNjr/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260719/aktmHetZ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://vod1.m